{"seq":2,"slug":"horticulture","title":"园艺学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/horticulture","introMarkdown":"# 园艺学 简介\n\n园艺学是研究蔬菜、果树和观赏植物的栽培管理与遗传改良的应用科学，涵盖了从田间种植到采后处理的完整产业链条。与大田作物学相比，园艺学的研究对象更加多样——从一棵苹果树到一盆兰花，从温室番茄到城市绿化带的景观植物——它们共同构成了人类饮食营养和生活审美的重要来源。\n\n自学者进入园艺学领域时会发现，这门学科兼具科学性和艺术性。蔬菜的种植需要精确的温光水肥管理，果树的修剪需要理解树体结构和光照分布，花卉的培育则在科学基础上融入了审美判断和市场需求的考量。园艺学的这种多面性使得它既适合对植物科学感兴趣的学习者，也适合对农业产业化和景观设计有志向的探索者。\n\n第一章**蔬菜学**聚焦蔬菜作物的分类特征、设施栽培技术和品种改良方向，这是保障城乡居民\"菜篮子\"供给的科学基础。第二章**果树学**探讨果树的生物学特性、果园建设与管理以及采后保鲜技术，关注如何提高果品的产量和品质。第三章**观赏园艺**涉及花卉栽培、园林植物应用和花卉产业运作，是将植物科学与审美创造结合的领域。第四章**园艺技术**介绍组织培养、温室环境控制和精准园艺等现代技术手段。\n\n建议根据个人兴趣选择一个方向深入——如果对食物生产感兴趣可以从蔬菜学或果树学入手，如果对设计和美学感兴趣则可以从观赏园艺切入。无论选择哪个方向，动手种植一些植物的实践体验都是不可替代的学习方式。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"vegetable-science","title":"蔬菜学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/horticulture/vegetable-science","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"vegetable-classification","title":"大学园艺学 — 蔬菜分类学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/horticulture/vegetable-science/vegetable-classification"},{"seq":2,"slug":"greenhouse-cultivation","title":"大学园艺学 — 温室栽培","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/horticulture/vegetable-science/greenhouse-cultivation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"soilless-culture","title":"大学园艺学 — 无土栽培","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/horticulture/vegetable-science/soilless-culture"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"fruit-science","title":"果树学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/horticulture/fruit-science","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fruit-tree-biology","title":"大学园艺学 — 果树生物学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/horticulture/fruit-science/fruit-tree-biology"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pruning-training","title":"大学园艺学 — 整形修剪","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/horticulture/fruit-science/pruning-training"},{"seq":3,"slug":"postharvest-technology","title":"大学园艺学 — 采后技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/horticulture/fruit-science/postharvest-technology"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"ornamental-plants","title":"观赏园艺","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/horticulture/ornamental-plants","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"landscape-design","title":"大学园艺学 — 园林设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/horticulture/ornamental-plants/landscape-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"flower-cultivation","title":"大学园艺学 — 花卉栽培","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/horticulture/ornamental-plants/flower-cultivation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"turf-management","title":"大学园艺学 — 草坪管理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/horticulture/ornamental-plants/turf-management"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"horticulture-technology","title":"园艺技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/horticulture/horticulture-technology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tissue-culture","title":"大学园艺学 — 组织培养","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/horticulture/horticulture-technology/tissue-culture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"grafting-techniques","title":"大学园艺学 — 嫁接技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/horticulture/horticulture-technology/grafting-techniques"},{"seq":3,"slug":"precision-agriculture","title":"大学园艺学 — 精准农业","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/horticulture/horticulture-technology/precision-agriculture"}]}]}